{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18696","headline":"巽公院五咏 净土堂 · 柳宗元","name":"巽公院五咏 净土堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结习自无始，沦溺穷苦源。\n流形及兹世，始悟三空门。\n华堂开净域，图像焕且繁。\n清冷焚衆香，微妙歌法言。\n稽首媿导师，超遥谢尘昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}